name geradwp
category Package
revision 63134
shortdesc Document class for the Cahiers du GERAD series
longdesc This package provides the geradwp class, a class based on
longdesc article and compatible with LaTeX. With this class, researchers
longdesc at GERAD will be able to write their working paper while
longdesc complying to all the presentation standards required by the
longdesc Cahiers du GERAD series.
